sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    box PUBLIC ZONE
        participant RS as Routing Service<br>trade-imports-<br>routing-proxy
        participant JF as Journey Frontend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-frontend
    end
    box PROTECTED ZONE
        participant SS as Session Service
        participant JB as Journey Backend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-backend
        participant PS as Permissions Service
    end
    participant IDM as IDM

    Note over SS,IDM: Role removed at IDM,<br>INS not told
    B->>RS: GET /gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>session cookie
    RS->>JF: GET /notifications/123<br>X-Forwarded-Prefix: /gbn-ag,<br>session cookie
    Note over JF: Sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    JF->>SS: GET /sessions/assertion<br>Ins-Session-Token, Sec-Fetch-*,<br>Ins-Browser-Accept
    Note over SS: Same-origin page load,<br>limits checked,<br>confirmation found due,<br>refreshToken decrypted
    Note over JF,SS: Page load waits for IDM's answer
    SS->>IDM: POST IDM token endpoint<br>grant_type=refresh_token,<br>client credentials
    Note over IDM: Current access<br>checked
    IDM-->>SS: 200 new tokens,<br>current roles
    Note over SS: ID token checked,<br>roles filtered,<br>tokens and roles written,<br>lastSeenAt written
    SS-->>JF: 200 session assertion<br>with new roles
    JF->>JB: GET /notifications/123<br>Ins-Session-Assertion
    Note over JB: Assertion checked
    JB->>PS: POST /permissions/expansions<br>new roles
    PS-->>JB: 200 permissions
    JB-->>JF: Operation refused
